---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Healing the Heart | You don't have to carry it alone">
  <section class="hero hero-home">
    <img class="hero-heart" src="/hero-heart.svg" alt="A cracked heart glowing with warm light" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow light">A safe place for healing</p>
      <h1>You don't have to carry it alone.</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">A Christ-centred journey where you can honestly face the wounds of your past, discover truth, and allow Jesus to bring healing and restoration.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/journey">Explore the journey</a><a class="button ghost" href="/what-to-expect">What to expect</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="welcome section">
    <div class="narrow center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before anything else</p>
      <h2>You are safe here.</h2>
      <p class="lead">You don't need to pretend you are okay.</p>
      <p>What happened to you matters. You don't have to be ashamed of the places in your heart that still hurt, and you don't have to rush through them.</p>
      <p>Healing is a journey of bringing what has been hidden into the light, replacing lies with truth, and discovering that <strong>Jesus is not frightened by your pain.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement-band"><p>Maybe healing really is possible.</p></section>

  <section class="section journey-preview">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The Healing &amp; Restoring the Heart journey</p><h2>There is a reason your heart learned to protect itself.</h2><p>We make room to understand what happened, what it changed, and what Jesus can restore.</p></div>
    <div class="cards four">
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey"><span>01</span><h3>A Safe Place</h3><p>Confidentiality, compassion, trust, honesty, and freedom from judgment.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#stony-heart"><span>02</span><h3>Understanding the Heart</h3><p>Explore how pain can cause us to harden, disconnect, protect, or stop trusting.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#loss"><span>03</span><h3>Grieving What Was Lost</h3><p>Give words to losses rather than burying or minimizing them.</p></a>
      <a class="feature-card" href="/journey#restoration"><span>04</span><h3>Truth &amp; Restoration</h3><p>Move toward healthy trust, identity, freedom, and wholeness.</p></a>
    </div>
    <div class="center"><a class="text-link" href="/journey">See the full journey →</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark-section section">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow light">What this is about</p><h2>Not fixing you. Walking with you.</h2><p>There are no spectators. The journey invites honest participation through teaching, reflection, prayer, journaling, small-group ministry, and safe relationships.</p></div>
    <div class="pillars"><div><b>Jesus</b><span>Our hope is rooted in Him.</span></div><div><b>Truth</b><span>We make space to recognize the lies pain can teach us.</span></div><div><b>Community</b><span>Healing does not have to happen in isolation.</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section next-step">
    <div class="split-callout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>You can take one small step.</h2></div><div><p>Learn about the journey, see what a class is like, or find upcoming opportunities when dates are available.</p><div class="actions left"><a class="button primary" href="/classes">View classes</a><a class="button outline" href="/contact">Ask a question</a></div></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-home {
    min-height: 82vh;
    background: #151c19;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero-heart {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    z-index: -2;
    filter: saturate(.94) contrast(1.04);
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    z-index: -1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8, 14, 12, .42) 0%, rgba(8, 14, 12, .16) 42%, rgba(8, 14, 12, .62) 100%),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(8, 14, 12, .52) 0%, rgba(8, 14, 12, .10) 48%, rgba(8, 14, 12, .38) 100%);
  }

  .hero-home::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 190px;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(21, 28, 25, 0) 0%, rgba(21, 28, 25, .42) 42%, #151c19 100%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    max-width: 980px;
    padding: 8rem 6vw;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.32);
  }

  .hero-content h1 {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero-home { min-height: 78vh; }
    .hero-heart { object-position: center; }
    .hero-overlay {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8,14,12,.48), rgba(8,14,12,.22) 38%, rgba(8,14,12,.72));
    }
    .hero-home::after { height: 150px; }
    .hero-content { padding: 6rem 6vw; }
  }
</style>
